# GHOPHOI - FIXTURE THUC TE (ban ve san xuat cua nguoi dung)
#
# Nhan dang tu ban ve that "GHOPPHOI TEST-1.dxf" bang chinh duong san xuat (GHOPHOI_BATCH),
# khong phai hinh ve tay cho de. Day la ban ve da lam lo ra diem yeu cua phep ghep hinh cong.
#
#   47 nhom chi tiet, tong SL 85
#   34 nhom co cung tron (dung sai day cung 0.05 mm)
#   556 lo ben trong
#   1743 dinh tren cac duong bao ngoai
#   to phoi 1500 x 3000, khe 5 mm, le mep 5 mm, xoay 0/90/180/270, khong lat guong
#
# Muc dich: khoa lai CHAT LUONG GHEP tren hinh that. Bat ky thay doi nao lam to dai them
# hoac lam sot chi tiet o day deu la buoc lui, du cac fixture ve tay co dep den may.
#
# Chay het khoang 17 giay - day la fixture nang nhat cua bo, va no dang gia tung do.
